<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on CS Group.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on CS Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of CS Group, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    180 CHF		   PREMIUM	10.69 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.15 CHF		  GEARING	15.04 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.JUN.97-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	02.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  173 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
